--- !u!114 &67570530
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 67570527}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f161123988b7474c9f5a46963c1fdf3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ShipAIPanel
  lines:
  - speakerName: Ship AI
    subtitle: Shit!! It looks like now that my systems are back up, we've been heading
      toward a black whole thie whole time. Now that you got the power on, you should
      search for the cockpit. Perhaps uncover the mystery to this whole opperation
      can help...
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a4f92f61c3293bf48936ff2787506fc9, type: 3}
    baseTypeSpeed: 0
    speedMultiplier: 0
    overrideTyping: 0
    overrideTypeSpeed: 0
    fallbackDuration: 0
    nextIndex: 0
    requiredItem: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2bec782ad73daeb4db2c22ea488ce7a9, type: 2}
    consumeItem: 0
    useTimerGate: 0
    triggerBeforeTime: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: Where is the cockpit?
      nextIndex: 6
    - choiceText: How do I uncover my memories?
      nextIndex: 7
  - speakerName: Ship AI
    subtitle: Make sure you get the power on. This will help you find the remaining
      memories so hopefully you can solve the mystery to this predicament.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a4f92f61c3293bf48936ff2787506fc9, type: 3}
    baseTypeSpeed: 0
    speedMultiplier: 0
    overrideTyping: 0
    overrideTypeSpeed: 0
    fallbackDuration: 0
    nextIndex: 0
    requiredItem: {fileID: 0}
    consumeItem: 0
    useTimerGate: 0
    triggerBeforeTime: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: How do I turn on the power?
      nextIndex: 2
    - choiceText: Should I focus on escape?
      nextIndex: 3
  - speakerName: Ship AI
    subtitle: You have to find the control panel. It's gotta be somewhere in this
      maze of endless servers. Just look for the hovering E.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a4f92f61c3293bf48936ff2787506fc9, type: 3}
    baseTypeSpeed: 0
    speedMultiplier: 0
    overrideTyping: 0
    overrideTypeSpeed: 0
    fallbackDuration: 0
    nextIndex: 100
    requiredItem: {fileID: 0}
    consumeItem: 0
    useTimerGate: 0
    triggerBeforeTime: 0
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Ship AI
    subtitle: 'You can''t escape this ship without a proper energy supply to the
      engine. Have you ever tried to drive a car without gas? '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a4f92f61c3293bf48936ff2787506fc9, type: 3}
    baseTypeSpeed: 0
    speedMultiplier: 0
    overrideTyping: 0
    overrideTypeSpeed: 0
    fallbackDuration: 0
    nextIndex: 4
    requiredItem: {fileID: 0}
    consumeItem: 0
    useTimerGate: 0
    triggerBeforeTime: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: How do I turn on the power?
      nextIndex: 1
    - choiceText: Should I focus on escape?
      nextIndex: 0
  - speakerName: Ship AI
    subtitle: ...
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a4f92f61c3293bf48936ff2787506fc9, type: 3}
    baseTypeSpeed: 0
    speedMultiplier: 0
    overrideTyping: 0
    overrideTypeSpeed: 0
    fallbackDuration: 0
    nextIndex: 5
    requiredItem: {fileID: 0}
    consumeItem: 0
    useTimerGate: 0
    triggerBeforeTime: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: How do I turn on the power?
      nextIndex: 1
    - choiceText: Should I focus on escape?
      nextIndex: 0
  - speakerName: Ship AI
    subtitle: idiot...
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a4f92f61c3293bf48936ff2787506fc9, type: 3}
    baseTypeSpeed: 0
    speedMultiplier: 0
    overrideTyping: 0
    overrideTypeSpeed: 0
    fallbackDuration: 0
    nextIndex: 100
    requiredItem: {fileID: 0}
    consumeItem: 0
    useTimerGate: 0
    triggerBeforeTime: 0
    choices: []
  - speakerName: Ship AI
    subtitle: I don't know... it might even be difficult to steer if you're not a
      liscenced professional. Just kidding... For now I suggest looking for you memories.
      Maybe then you can remember where he escape pods are.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a4f92f61c3293bf48936ff2787506fc9, type: 3}
    baseTypeSpeed: 0
    speedMultiplier: 0
    overrideTyping: 0
    overrideTypeSpeed: 0
    fallbackDuration: 0
    nextIndex: 0
    requiredItem: {fileID: 0}
    consumeItem: 0
    useTimerGate: 0
    triggerBeforeTime: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: How long untili impact?
      nextIndex: 8
  - speakerName: Ship AI
    subtitle: You're memories seem to appear as physical reincarnated objects that
      represent shattered glass.... try searching the ship for them. I recomment
      searching Pod 1 and Pod 2.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a4f92f61c3293bf48936ff2787506fc9, type: 3}
    baseTypeSpeed: 0
    speedMultiplier: 0
    overrideTyping: 0
    overrideTypeSpeed: 0
    fallbackDuration: 0
    nextIndex: 0
    requiredItem: {fileID: 0}
    consumeItem: 0
    useTimerGate: 0
    triggerBeforeTime: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: How long until impact?
      nextIndex: 8
  - speakerName: Ship AI
    subtitle: '{Time} until the black hole impact. I suggest you hurry.'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    typingSFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a4f92f61c3293bf48936ff2787506fc9, type: 3}
    baseTypeSpeed: 0
    speedMultiplier: 0
    overrideTyping: 0
    overrideTypeSpeed: 0
    fallbackDuration: 0
    nextIndex: 100
    requiredItem: {fileID: 0}
    consumeItem: 0
    useTimerGate: 0
    triggerBeforeTime: 0
    choices: []
